WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.097
A narrative needs an identifiable setting, believable characters, a problem, ordered

00:00:05.097 --> 00:00:06.877
events and a resolution.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:13.100
A child returned extra change to a trader. Which value did the child show? Answer:

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:13.460
Honesty

00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:19.361
Create an original story with two characters, a setting, a challenge and a convincing

00:00:19.361 --> 00:00:19.723
ending.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:23.456
Why it works: Returning what is not yours is honest.
